        "eyebrow": "The Cacao Guide · Part 08 of 10",
        "title": "Grown Closer To The Sky",
        "deck": "What happens to cacao when it grows closer to the sky, and why the air, soil, and climate of altitude produce something lowland farms simply cannot.",
